{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54074","headline":"和江西李助副使早登开元寺阁 · 陈陶","name":"和江西李助副使早登开元寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空（按：《全唐诗》卷七四五此诗，第十五句缺一字。\n检胡震亨《唐首戊签》八〖《统签》卷五九七〗，收此诗於雍陶名下，题作《登武昌江山寺》，第十五句不缺，作「书剑忽若空」。\n全诗较长，不重录。\n胡氏未云因何收归雍陶名下。\n《唐音戊签余》二八陈陶名下重收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}